<title>BELGIUM: Anglo offers to cut Lonrho stake. [CORRECTED 08:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Anglo offers to cut Lonrho stake. [CORRECTED 08:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corp has offered to cut its 28.4-percent stake in Lonrho Plc, following European Commission opposition to it having control of the platinum division of the British conglomerate, a senior EU official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The official declined to be specific about the exact reduction, but indicated that the final stake would be in the region of nine to 10 percent (corrects to make clear that the final stake is to be nine to 10 percent).</p>
</text>
